    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to stand still, to linger, to stand quietly in one place",
      "explanation": "To stand motionless in a place, often with a sense of contemplation, solitude, or quiet presence. A literary and evocative word."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
